hip#button-composition","content":"Button composition"},"209":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-19","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"210":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-20","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"211":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-21","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"212":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-22","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#a-chipgroup-has-no-accessible-name","content":"A ChipGroup has no accessible name"},"213":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-23","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#the-remove-action-does-not-update-the-ui","content":"The remove action does not update the UI"},"214":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-24","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#a-composed-label-is-not-truncating-correctly","content":"A composed label is not truncating correctly"},"215":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-25","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#the-menu-trigger-does-not-look-like-a-chip","content":"The menu trigger does not look like a Chip"},"216":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-26","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#props","content":"Props"},"217":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-27","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chip","content":"Chip"},"218":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-28","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chipgroup","content":"ChipGroup"},"219":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-29","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chiplist","content":"ChipList"},"220":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-30","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chipbutton","content":"ChipButton"},"221":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-31","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"},"222":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-32","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Toggle Chips for selecting multiple peer filters"},"223":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-33","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Removable Chips for user-added filters and input tokens"},"224":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-34","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Shared `sm`, `md`, and `lg` sizes, with optional leading icons"},"225":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-35","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"},"226":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-36","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#default","content":"Start with a labeled group of related values. Add selection or removal when\nthe group needs interactive behavior."},"227":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-37","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#toggle-chips","content":"Use Toggle Chips for multiple peer filters. The Chip render prop supplies\nselection state for the checkmark, while `textValue` names composed content."},"228":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-38","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#removable-chips","content":"Use Removable Chips for user-added filters and tokens. `ChipGroup` reports\nremoved keys through `onRemove`; the owner updates its collection. A\nself-closing `Button` in the `remove` slot supplies each remove control."},"229":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-39","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#controlled-selection","content":"Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` when another part of the page\nneeds to own the selected filter state."},"230":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-40","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#sizes","content":"Compare the supported `sm`, `md`, and `lg` sizes. Set `size` on `ChipGroup`\nso every Chip inherits one consistent size."},"231":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-41","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#disabled","content":"Disable individual options with `disabledKeys` when some values are unavailable."},"232":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-42","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#truncation","content":"By default, long labels truncate visually when space is constrained, while\nthe complete accessible value remains available."},"233":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-43","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#empty-state","content":"Give an empty collection useful guidance, then let the user add the first\nvalue. Removable items continue to be owned by the collection."},"234":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-44","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#menu-filter-trigger","content":"Use `ChipButton` for Chip presentation without collection semantics.\n`MenuTrigger` continues to own open state, focus, and keyboard behavior."},"235":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-45","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#content","content":"Use a string for a simple label. For icons or other composed content, wrap the\nvisible label in `Text` and provide `textValue` for the accessible name. See\n**Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips** above."},"236":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-46","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#selection-and-removal","content":"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."},"237":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-47","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#layout-and-sizing","content":"Set `size` on `ChipGroup` to keep a collection consistent. `ChipList` wraps by\ndefault and accepts layout props for custom arrangements. See **Sizes**."},"238":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-48","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#button-composition","content":"Use `ChipButton` when Chip presentation is needed without collection semantics.\nCompose it with components such as `MenuTrigger`; those components continue to\nown open state, focus, and keyboard behavior. See **Menu filter trigger**."},"239":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-49","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use `Label` or `aria-label` to name the `ChipGroup`; this names the collection,\nnot its individual Chips."},"240":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-50","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Give each Chip a visible label, `textValue`, or `aria-label`. Use `textValue`\nwhen a Chip contains icons, composed content, or a render prop."},"241":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-51","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use a descriptive group label so removal actions can be announced clearly."},"242":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-52","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Keep the visible label and the accessible value synchronized."},"243":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-53","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."},"244":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-54","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Keep labels concise and let them truncate only when the available width requires it."},"245":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-55","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Prefer groups of three or more related values."},"246":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-56","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Keep one size per group."},"247":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-57","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Let `ChipList` wrap instead of forcing a single horizontal line."},"248":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-58","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Use removable Chips for user-added filters and tokens."},"249":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-59","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"For menu filters, use `ChipButton` with `MenuTrigger` and provide the chevron explicitly."},"250":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-60","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#a-chipgroup-has-no-accessible-name","content":"Add a visible `Label` to the group or provide `aria-label`. For an individual Chip\nwith composed content, provide a visible label, `textValue`, or `aria-label`."},"251":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-61","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#the-remove-action-does-not-update-the-ui","content":"Add `onRemove` to `ChipGroup` and remove the returned keys from the collection\nowned by your application."},"252":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-62","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#a-composed-label-is-not-truncating-correctly","content":"Keep the label in `Text`, preserve `textValue`, and constrain the available width\nof the surrounding layout. Truncation is visual; the complete accessible value\nshould remain available."},"253":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-63","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#the-menu-trigger-does-not-look-like-a-chip","content":"Use `ChipButton` inside `MenuTrigger`, include the visible value, and add a\ntrailing chevron to communicate that the control opens a menu."},"254":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-64","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#props","content":"For a menu trigger, the button and menu are composed as siblings inside\n`MenuTrigger`:"},"255":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"page","content":"Checkbox","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox"},"256":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-0","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox","content":"Accessible checkbox component for multi-select options with support for indeterminate states, validation, keyboard navigation, and flexible group layouts."},"257":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-1","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#installation","content":"Installation"},"258":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-2","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#examples","content":"Examples"},"259":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-3","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#default","content":"Default"},"260":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-4","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate","content":"Indeterminate"},"261":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-5","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#checkbox-group","content":"Checkbox Group"},"262":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-6","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"263":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-7","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#horizontal-layout","content":"Horizontal Layout"},"264":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-8","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#disabled-states","content":"Disabled States"},"265":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-9","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#required-indicator","content":"Required Indicator"},"266":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-10","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#invalid-state","content":"Invalid State"},"267":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-11","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#customization","content":"Customization"},"268":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-12","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"Data Attributes"},"269":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-13","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#component-customization","content":"Component Customization"},"270":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-14","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#key-features","content":"Key Features"},"271":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-15","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state","content":"Indeterminate State"},"272":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-16","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"Group Validation"},"273":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-17","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#orientation","content":"Orientation"},"274":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-18","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"275":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-19","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"Keyboard Navigation"},"276":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-20","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"ARIA Support"},"277":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-21","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"278":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-22","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#selection-not-updating","content":"Selection Not Updating"},"279":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-23","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state-not-updating","content":"Indeterminate State Not Updating"},"280":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-24","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#styling-overrides-not-applying","content":"Styling Overrides Not Applying"},"281":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-25","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation-not-working","content":"Keyboard Navigation Not Working"},"282":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-26","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"283":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-27","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"When to Use Checkboxes"},"284":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-28","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Label Guidelines"},"285":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-29","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#validation","content":"Validation"},"286":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-30","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Group Organization"},"287":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-31","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#props","content":"Props"},"288":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-32","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#checkbox","content":"Checkbox"},"289":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-33","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#checkboxgroup","content":"CheckboxGroup"},"290":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-34","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/checkbox#checkboxindicator","content":"CheckboxIndicator"},"291":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-35","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#default","content":"A single checkbox with a label."},"292":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-36","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate","content":"Checkboxes can display an indeterminate state (neither checked nor unchecked), with the use of the `isIndeterminate` prop, commonly used for \"select all\" functionality when some but not all child items are selected."},"293":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-37","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#checkbox-group","content":"Group multiple checkboxes together with a shared label."},"294":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-38","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#controlled","content":"Manage checkbox group state programmatically with controlled component pattern."},"295":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-39","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#horizontal-layout","content":"Display checkboxes in a horizontal row instead of vertical stack."},"296":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-40","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#disabled-states","content":"Individual checkboxes within a group can be disabled while others remain interactive."},"297":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-41","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#required-indicator","content":"Mark a checkbox group as required with visual indicator and validation."},"298":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-42","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#invalid-state","content":"Display error state and error message for validation feedback."},"299":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-43","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#customization","content":"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."},"300":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-44","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"301":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-45","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"302":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-46","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"303":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-47","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a checkbox field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive checkbox state:"},"304":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-48","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop displays a minus icon to represent a partial selection state. This is useful for \"select all\" checkboxes when only some items in a collection are selected."},"305":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-49","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"CheckboxGroup supports validation states and error messages:"},"306":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-50","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"},"307":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-51","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"},"308":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-52","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"},"309":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-53","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#orientation","content":"Use `orientation=\"vertical\"` (default) to stack checkboxes, or `orientation=\"horizontal\"` to arrange them in a row."},"310":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-54","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"},"311":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-55","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":